{
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "title_0",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Respect is the relationship."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_1",
   "who": "Alex",
   "text": "Okay, serious question. What actually makes a relationship healthy?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_2",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "Trust?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_3",
   "who": "Maya",
   "text": "Not arguing all the time?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_4",
   "who": "Jordan",
   "text": "Being able to be yourself?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_5",
   "who": "Alex",
   "text": "Exactly. But what does that actually look like?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1_7",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Relationships aren't just about dating. They include friendships, family relationships, classmates and people we care about."
  },
  {
   "id": "s2_1",
   "who": "Maya",
   "text": "Sorry, I don't really feel like coming today."
  },
  {
   "id": "s2_2",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "That's okay. Maybe another time."
  },
  {
   "id": "s2_4",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "First: respect."
  },
  {
   "id": "s2_6",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Respect means understanding that someone else's feelings, opinions and choices matter too."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_1",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "Let me see your messages."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_2",
   "who": "Jordan",
   "text": "I'd rather keep my messages private."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_3",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "But if we're friends, you should show me."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_4",
   "who": "Jordan",
   "text": "Being friends doesn't mean I have to give up my privacy."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_6",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "Fair enough."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_8",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Everyone has boundaries. That could mean needing personal space, keeping something private, or saying no to something you're uncomfortable with."
  },
  {
   "id": "s3_9",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "And remember: No means no. You don't have to feel guilty for setting a boundary."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4_1",
   "who": "Alex",
   "text": "Come on, just do it. Everyone else is."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4_2",
   "who": "Maya",
   "text": "I don't want to."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4_3",
   "who": "Alex",
   "text": "Seriously? Don't be boring."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4_5",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Pressure isn't respect."
  },
  {
   "id": "s4_6",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "You should never have to do something just to keep a friend, impress someone or prove that you care."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5_1",
   "who": "Jordan",
   "text": "When you didn't invite me yesterday, I felt left out."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5_2",
   "who": "Sam",
   "text": "I didn't realise you felt that way. I'm sorry."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5_3",
   "who": "Jordan",
   "text": "Thanks for listening."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5_5",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Good communication doesn't mean you never disagree."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5_6",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "It means being honest about how you feel, listening to the other person and trying to solve problems without insulting, threatening or humiliating each other."
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_1",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Sometimes, a relationship can become unhealthy."
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_2",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Checking your phone or messages without asking"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_3",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Telling you who you can and can't see"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_4",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Put-downs and “jokes” that hurt"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_5",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Making you feel guilty for saying no"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_6",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Jealousy, anger or threats when you disagree"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6_7",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Pressure to “prove” that you care"
  },
  {
   "id": "end_0",
   "who": "N",
   "text": "Respect is the relationship. If something doesn't feel right, talk to someone you trust: a friend, family member, teacher or school counsellor."
  }
 ],
